    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/9a753b3dddfa3d45933e2932193dd615.poster.avif?t=1755092989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/9a753b3dddfa3d45933e2932193dd615.webm?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/9a753b3dddfa3d45933e2932193dd615.mp4?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOOD RUSH</strong> is an intense roguelite FPS in development inspired by genre titans such as <i>ULTRAKILL</i> and <i>Hades</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a procedurally generated Hell, seize unique weapons, unlock new abilities, and create powerful synergies to overcome the challenges standing between you and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.poster.avif?t=1755092989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.webm?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.mp4?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is unforgiving, your movement skills will be your greatest asset against the relentless hordes of enemies. Whether you choose to dodge attacks from a safe distance or adopt a more aggressive approach, a well-placed headshot will always make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.poster.avif?t=1755092989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.webm?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.mp4?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idols and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of Hell and harness the power of <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Idols</strong>, granting you powerful upgrades and unique abilities. Adapt your playstyle on the go based on the synergies you discover and the opportunities you seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.poster.avif?t=1755092989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.webm?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.mp4?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a state of <i>flow</i> during combat to restore your health and gain various bonuses. This state is achieved by actively engaging with the game\u2019s combat mechanics and playing dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die... and Try Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will inevitably fall\u2026 but this is not the end, <strong>you are already dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persevere, learn from each failure, and push ever forward in your quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/9a753b3dddfa3d45933e2932193dd615.poster.avif?t=1755092989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/9a753b3dddfa3d45933e2932193dd615.webm?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/9a753b3dddfa3d45933e2932193dd615.mp4?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOOD RUSH</strong> is an intense roguelite FPS in development inspired by genre titans such as <i>ULTRAKILL</i> and <i>Hades</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a procedurally generated Hell, seize unique weapons, unlock new abilities, and create powerful synergies to overcome the challenges standing between you and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.poster.avif?t=1755092989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.webm?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.mp4?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is unforgiving, your movement skills will be your greatest asset against the relentless hordes of enemies. Whether you choose to dodge attacks from a safe distance or adopt a more aggressive approach, a well-placed headshot will always make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.poster.avif?t=1755092989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.webm?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.mp4?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idols and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of Hell and harness the power of <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Idols</strong>, granting you powerful upgrades and unique abilities. Adapt your playstyle on the go based on the synergies you discover and the opportunities you seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.poster.avif?t=1755092989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.webm?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.mp4?t=1755092989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a state of <i>flow</i> during combat to restore your health and gain various bonuses. This state is achieved by actively engaging with the game\u2019s combat mechanics and playing dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die... and Try Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will inevitably fall\u2026 but this is not the end, <strong>you are already dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persevere, learn from each failure, and push ever forward in your quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "BLOOD RUSH is a fast paced, skill based FPS, mixed with roguelites elements. Upgrade yourself, buy unique guns, drain miracles from relics and destroy anyone or anything standing on your way!",
